We have Google Docs, Discord.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.580
I'm actually started a Discord server.

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:41.760
So just pace yourself.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:42.860
I'm pacing myself.

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:45.040
I never use discord that much before,

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.810
but now that I've been
doing a lot of like,

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.310
Animal Crossing stuff, trying
to connect with you guys,

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:51.040
and doing a lot more streaming,

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:52.040
especially with my sister,

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:53.410
who just started her Twitch channel,

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:54.570
which is really exciting.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:57.550
Discord reminds me of
the old school IRC days.

00:09:57.550 --> 00:10:01.020
That's where I spent so much
of, well it's not my childhood.

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:03.030
I mean, I guess I still
was technically a child,

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:04.040
but all through high school,

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:06.410
like IRC was what I
spent most of my time on.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:09.630
Frame.io, this is what we
use to do file transfers.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:12.750
I have a full video
coming out very shortly,

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.230
talking about our work from home workflow.

00:10:15.230 --> 00:10:17.400
And Frame.io plays such
a huge part in that.

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:19.490
Photoshop for iPad, is pretty awesome.

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:21.490
It's obviously not a full fledged version,

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:24.170
like on a desktop, but if you need to do,

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:25.260
pretty much most of the things,

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:26.540
that you would need to do in Photoshop,

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:28.180
you can do it here on the iPad.

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:30.450
So that's everything that
is on my iPad right now.

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:32.280
I would love to know if
there's any other apps

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:33.530
you guys would like me to check out.

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:34.750
I'm so excited though,

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:37.210
because I do plan on
doing a full AR video,

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:39.300
when some of the new
AR apps are coming out,

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:40.840
that support the LiDAR sensor.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:42.890
But until then, hope
you guys are doing well,

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:45.050
and I look forward to
seeing you guys in the raid.

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:46.970
Don't forget to join my clan.

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:50.380
Vimana video games that I used
to play was pretty excessive,

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:53.380
and then I found Jiu
Jitsu about two years ago.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:56.870
So that kind of took over
almost all of my free time.

00:10:56.870 --> 00:11:00.210
Jiu Jitsu for me was kind
of like a real life video,

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:02.470
because there's strategy involved,

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.950
you're also getting the
added physical benefits,

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:06.040
of working out,

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:09.350
while also kind of challenging
your skills and strategy,

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.770
so I really, really miss it a lot.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:16.957
But I also miss playing video games.

00:11:16.957 --> 00:11:19.540
(upbeat music)

